{"sections":[{"slug":"统计系综","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"统计系综"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">统计系综</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“统计系综”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">统计系综</span></strong> (ensemble) <span lang=\"zh\">是大量具有同样宏观性质的系统的集合</span>.</p>\n<p>Maxwell <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> Boltzmann <span lang=\"zh\">认为</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">宏观物理量的测量值是相应的微观量</span> $B(q,p)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的时间平均</span>:\n$$\r\n\\overline{B} (t_0) = \\frac{1}{\\tau} \\int_{t_0}^{t_0+\\tau} dt\\, B(q(t),p(t)).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由于宏观系统的复杂性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">很难从纯力学上继续对它的宏观物理量进行任何具体的计算</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">为了能进一步得到系统的宏观统计性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">必须引入统计物理的假设</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中最有名的是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/遍历假设","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">遍历理论</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/遍历假设","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">遍历理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则一个宏观系统物理量的时间平均值与系综平均值是等价的</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}